Package: asgard-multimedia
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: metapackages
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 asgard-gnome-desktop,
 totem,
 totem-plugins,
 rhythmbox,
 rhythmbox-plugins,
 gnome-music,
 gnome-sound-recorder,
 shotwell,
 cheese,
 rygel-playbin,
 rygel-tracker
Description: @DISTRIBUTION@ multimedia playback + capture
 Adds the GNOME multimedia app stack on top of the base desktop:
 .
   * totem + totem-plugins        video playback
   * rhythmbox + rhythmbox-plugins music library + playback
   * gnome-music                   alternative music browser
   * gnome-sound-recorder          quick audio capture
   * shotwell                      photo library / editor
   * cheese                        webcam + photobooth
   * rygel-playbin + rygel-tracker UPnP/DLNA media server
 .
 Codec packages (gstreamer1.0-libav, gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly) are
 NOT depended on here — install them separately if you need
 patent-encumbered codec support (mp3, h264, etc.); they live in
 contrib / non-free and require explicit operator opt-in via apt.
 .
 Selecting this metapackage automatically pulls asgard-gnome-desktop.
